
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CREDIT-SIMPLE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CREDIT-SCORE     PIC 9(3)  VALUE 700.
01 WS-MONTHLY-INCOME   PIC 9(7)  VALUE 30000.
01 WS-MONTHLY-DEBT     PIC 9(7)  VALUE 5000.

01 WS-MIN-SCORE        PIC 9(3)  VALUE 650.
01 WS-MIN-INCOME       PIC 9(7)  VALUE 20000.
01 WS-MAX-DTI          PIC 9(3)  VALUE 43.

01 WS-DTI              PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.
01 WS-RESULT           PIC X(4)  VALUE "PASS".
01 WS-REASON           PIC X(40) VALUE SPACES.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.


    IF WS-CREDIT-SCORE < WS-MIN-SCORE
        MOVE "FAIL" TO WS-RESULT
        MOVE "SCORE TOO LOW" TO WS-REASON

    ELSE IF WS-MONTHLY-INCOME < WS-MIN-INCOME
        MOVE "FAIL" TO WS-RESULT
        MOVE "INCOME TOO LOW" TO WS-REASON

    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-DTI = (WS-MONTHLY-DEBT * 100) / WS-MONTHLY-INCOME
        IF WS-DTI > WS-MAX-DTI
            MOVE "FAIL" TO WS-RESULT
            MOVE "DEBT-TO-INCOME TOO HIGH" TO WS-REASON
        END-IF
    END-IF

    DISPLAY "RESULT: " WS-RESULT
    DISPLAY "REASON: " WS-REASON

    STOP RUN.
